# sources/ folders are middens — private studio material per Prime
# Directive 6 (§2). They NEVER publish and they never get committed either.
# Only ductus.json + specimen.txt + manifest.yml leave an aesthetic folder —
# which is why corpus.txt is ignored too: it's not on the leave-list. Its
# phrases travel inside the compiled ductus; the raw corpus stays home.
# [PLACED DEFAULT — spec §19, veto-able. Consequence worth knowing: your
# middens and corpora live ONLY on this machine. Back them up somewhere
# private if you care about them — git is not doing it for you here.]
aesthetics/*/sources/
aesthetics/*/corpus.txt
